sequenceDiagram
 title Finalisasi Penilaian Kinerja
 actor OD as OD
 participant UI as Dashboard PA
 participant S as Layanan PA
 participant DB as Data PA
 actor E as Karyawan
 OD->>UI: Finalisasi penilaian
 UI->>S: Periksa normalisasi seluruh departemen
 alt Semua departemen selesai
